{
    "id":  11707,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Hippo Connector with Cable for LED Strips 24V RGB+CCT SMD | IP20 | 6 Pins | 10mm",
    "reference":  "SPRGBCCT-10MM",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHippo quick connector with 6-pin cable\u003c/strong\u003e for joining 10mm SMD RGB+CCT LED strips to the controller. IP20 design, practical and safe: just press and connect. Includes cable. Compatible with REF: SP216D-RGBCCT-91353.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eHippo Connector with Cable for 24V RGB+CCT LED Strips | IP20 | 6 Pins | 10mm\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOptimize your LED lighting installations with this practical Hippo connector with 16 cm cable, specially designed for 10mm wide SMD RGB+CCT LED strips.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSolderless installation:\u003c/strong\u003e Forget about soldering and specialized tools. With its click system, you’ll have a secure and fast connection in seconds.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTransparent design:\u003c/strong\u003e Allows easy verification of proper cable placement and ensures stable, efficient current transmission.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy to use:\u003c/strong\u003e Open the connector, insert the LED strip into the slot and press the clips to secure it. Done, no hassle!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGuaranteed compatibility:\u003c/strong\u003e Ideal for 24V RGB+CCT LED strips with 10mm PCB. Compatible with our model REF: SP216D-RGBCCT-91353.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith this Hippo connector, you’ll get a clean, fast and secure installation, optimizing your lighting in seconds.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplications:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLED lighting installations in homes, offices, shops and decorative projects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDIY lighting projects without soldering knowledge.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick replacement of connections in existing LED lighting systems.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e",
